XIRON BALLS:
X
XThe punishment scroll gives you an extremely powerful weapon: the
XIron Ball. Although the cockatrice is more powerful, it has the
disadvantages Xof disintegrating and of destroying all edible
monster. The iron ball, Xalthough very heavy, can kill many monsters
in one swing, and almost every Xmonster in two. Try wielding it some
time. The authors neglect to Xmention that you have to get the thing
off your ankle. I believe this Xcan be done via remove curse, or by
praying. I know it can be done by Xpolymorphing yourself into a Nymph
and using the #remove command. X
XNURSES AND THE SPELL OF EXTRA-HEALING:
X
XBoth of these allow the user to gain an enormous number of hp. The
Xspell grants the user hit points each time it is cast, so the user
can Xwith this spell increase his maximum hit points as many times as
he has the Xmana to do it. No longer true, since the spell has a
finite number of Xuses.
X
XNurses will cast extra healing on any character they "attack" which
Xis not wearing any armor. This means that by letting a nurse attack
you for Xa long period of time, you can gain literally hundreds of
hit points. X
XFINDING THE WANDS OF WISHING ON THE 26TH LEVEL AND BELOW:
X
XEach level below the 25th has a wand of wishing on it. The wands are
Xlocated beneath a large boulder ("`") which is adjacent to 3 walls.
To get Xone of the wands, use a wand of digging to create a hole next
to the boulder Xand push the boulder away. Using a wand of striking
will work also. You Xcan also remove most of your goodies, and move
toward the rock again. XThis will let you crawl under it to get the
wand. X
XTHE MEDUSA:
X
XA new creature, the medusa, has been added as of NetHack 2.2. She is
Xa unique monster, shown by the symbol "8". She guards the lower
levels, Xand can be tough to defeat, since looking at her will
instantly turn you Xto stone. Two items have been added to help you:
the mirror, and the Xblindfold. Using these is the most popular
method of destroying the medusa, Xbut there are others. You can blind
yourself with a camera or quaff a Xpotion of blindness and attack her.
X
XGOING BELOW THE 26TH LEVEL:
X
XTo go below the 26th level, you must be confused and read a teleport
Xscroll with a ring of teleport control on. This allows you to
teleport to a Xlower level. The dungeon goes down to the 40th level,
and none of the levels Xbeyond the 26th have stairs going down. 40 is
no longer the lowest Xlevel, and the Wizard isn't always there.
X
XSURVIVING THE 40TH LEVEL.
X
XYou MUST have fire resistance to enter the 40th level and live. The
Xamulet is guarded by a powerful wizard and his hell hound. They are
located Xin the center of the level, surrounded by a moat, and an
inner wall. XIt looks like this:
X
X ~~~~~~
X ~----~
X ~|..|~
X ~----~
X ~~~~~~
XThe wizard is located in the center. You can levitate over the
water, or you Xcan destroy a space of water with a wand of fire. Once
over the water, use Xa wand of digging to blast open the wall, fight
the wizard and retrieve the Xamulet. Now leave the dungeon, and
